  The draft says the power cut is 'நாளை' (tomorrow) and gives the date as 'நவம்பர் 13ஆம் தேதி வெள்ளிக்கிழமை'. The article only says the maintenance is on Friday and gives the headline 'இன்று' (today); the date 13 November and the 'tomorrow' framing are not stated in the article.
  The article's headline says the power cut is 'இன்று' (today), while the draft's headline, reel_script, slides and caption all say 'நாளை' (tomorrow), contradicting the article's timing.
  The reel_script lists 'எ. பாதா்பேட்டை' as 'பாதர்பேட்டை' and drops the 'எ.' prefix; the article's area is 'எ. பாதா்பேட்டை', so the place name is altered.
  The slides_spec lists areas that are missing 'வைரபெருமாள்பட்டி' and 'கல்லாங்குத்து' and similar omissions; the slide 'எந்தப் பகுதிகள்?' also omits many listed areas, which is acceptable as a summary, but the slide text 'மாராடி' is placed under a list that mixes unrelated groups, not a factual error by itself.
  The draft adds the advice to prepare water and mobile charging in advance, which is not stated in the article.
